# Tickets

Task 04 backlog. Fifteen tickets, each with **Why**, **Done when**, and **Touches**. Numbers are the execution order. Each ticket is one `feature/<slug>` branch and one pull request (`workflow.md`). A ticket is done only when every "Done when" box is ticked on `staging`.

Already done in week 4 (no ticket): project setup, router, S1 list with the closed toggle and nationality filter (R1 code, R4, R5a), `storage.js`, `check-data.js`, and the letter function (R19 code, D12).

For every ticket with UI, "done" also means it works at 375px width and with keyboard only (R22, rules 19 and 20).

